{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfCNsE4zEB9UbqWRUiWK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have what I need. Here is the plan:\n\n- **Game:** \"Mad Men at Large\", an original 1960s Madison Avenue workweek in the engine's 3/4 view. Three days, three client pitches, and a timing-based pitch minigame. Stats for Standing, Composure, Whiskey and Home trade off against each other, and the endings depend on the choices.\n- **Engine:** the full my-3d2dge 0.85.1, inlined into one HTML file.\n- **Hub:** parallel mode, 1–4 players, `session.js` unmodified as the first script in `<head>`.\n\nI'll set up the dev folder with the vendored engine and hub client first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15644,"cache_read_input_tokens":101874,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":15644,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"15bc258b-d291-4236-a54a-0598527cb274","uuid":"fcc52969-16fc-4f06-a726-efa4ba66b79f","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:22:17.057Z","request_id":"req_011CgfCNrsVFt31BEwZ3SVRV"}
